WEBVTT

00:01:27.792 --> 00:01:32.434
And a divide is exactly what happens
with human language,

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:35.934
and the processing of that language.

00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:40.184
I of course am working
out of a small lab at MIT.

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:42.809
(Laughter)

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:46.184
And we are scraping
for every insight that we can get.

00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:47.268
(Laughter)

00:01:47.292 --> 00:01:52.351
This is not often associated
with a computational challenge,

00:01:52.375 --> 00:01:56.726
but in this case,
we found that persistence of vision

00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:59.101
and auditory intake

00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:02.976
actually have more in common
than we ever realized,